<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">answer</ansi>

Some places ask a question and wait for a reply. The <ansi fg="command">answer</ansi>
command gives one. Only the right answer opens what the room is keeping
shut, and a wrong one is rarely free.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">answer the moon</ansi>
  Answer the riddle in this room with "the moon".
